      "title": {
        "en": "Kim jest Jan?"
      },
      "body": {
        "en": "One person is many things in a family. Jan *jest dziadkiem, ojcem i mężem*; Ewa *jest babcią, matką i żoną*. After *jest*, a man's family word ends in *-em* and a woman's in *-ą*, as *lekarzem* and *lekarką* did. *Kim jest ta pani?* asks who she is."
      },
